#: ../../files/quota.rst:3
msgid "Storage quota"
msgstr "Lagerkvote"

#: ../../files/quota.rst:5
msgid ""
"Your Nextcloud administrator can set a storage quota for your account. Open "
"your Personal settings page to see your quota and how much storage you have "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Din Nextcloud-administrator kan sætte en lagerkvote for din konto. Åbn siden"
" med dine personlige indstillinger for at se din kvote, og hvor meget "
"lagerplads du har brugt."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:9
msgid "Storage quota indicator on the Personal page"
msgstr "Visning af lagerkvoten på siden med personlige indstillinger"

#: ../../files/quota.rst:12
msgid "It may be helpful to understand how your quota is calculated."
msgstr "Det kan være nyttigt at forstå, hvordan din kvote beregnes."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:14
msgid ""
"Metadata such as thumbnails, temporary files, caches, and encryption keys "
"can use disk space without counting against your user quota. Some apps store"
" data in the database, such as the Calendar and Contacts apps. This data is "
"not included in the file-storage quota."
msgstr ""
"Metadata som miniaturer, midlertidige filer, cache og krypteringsnøgler kan "
"bruge diskplads uden at tælle med i din brugerkvote. Nogle apps, f.eks. "
"Kalender og Kontakter, gemmer data i databasen. De data tæller ikke med i "
"kvoten for fillagring."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:19
msgid ""
"When other users share files with you, the shared files normally count "
"against the original owner's quota. When you share a folder and allow other "
"users or groups to upload or edit files in it, those files count against "
"your quota. When you re-share files shared with you, the re-share normally "
"continues to count against the original owner's quota."
msgstr ""
"Når andre brugere deler filer med dig, tæller de delte filer normalt med i "
"den oprindelige ejers kvote. Når du deler en mappe og lader andre brugere "
"eller grupper overføre eller redigere filer i den, tæller de filer med i din"
" kvote. Når du videredeler filer, der er delt med dig, tæller videredelingen"
" normalt fortsat med i den oprindelige ejers kvote."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:25
msgid ""
"Encrypted files can use more physical storage than unencrypted files. The "
"quota calculation uses the file size reported by Nextcloud's storage layer."
msgstr ""
"Krypterede filer kan fylde mere fysisk lagerplads end ukrypterede. Kvoten "
"beregnes ud fra den filstørrelse, som Nextclouds lagerlag oplyser."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:28
msgid ""
"When the Versions app is enabled, older file versions are managed separately"
" from the normal storage quota according to the app's retention and storage "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"Når appen Versioner er slået til, styres ældre versioner af filer separat "
"fra den almindelige lagerkvote efter appens regler for opbevaring og "
"lagerplads."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:32
msgid ""
"If you create a public share through a URL and allow uploads, uploaded files"
" count against your quota."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du opretter en offentlig deling via en URL og tillader overførsler, "
"tæller de overførte filer med i din kvote."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:36
msgid "Deleted files and the trash bin"
msgstr "Slettede filer og papirkurven"

#: ../../files/quota.rst:38
msgid ""
"Files and folders in your trash bin do not count against your normal storage"
" quota. The trash bin nevertheless has its own storage limit."
msgstr ""
"Filer og mapper i papirkurven tæller ikke med i din almindelige lagerkvote. "
"Papirkurven har dog sin egen lagergrænse."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:41
msgid ""
"For accounts with a quota, the default amount of space available to the "
"trash bin is calculated as 50% of the account's remaining quota space. This "
"is calculated after the account's active files have been taken into account;"
" it is not 50% of the total quota."
msgstr ""
"For konti med en kvote beregnes papirkurvens standardplads som 50 % af den "
"plads, der er tilbage i kontoens kvote. Den beregnes, efter at kontoens "
"aktive filer er talt med. Den er altså ikke 50 % af den samlede kvote."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:46
msgid ""
"For accounts without a quota, the default trash-bin limit is calculated "
"using available filesystem space instead. An administrator can configure a "
"global or per-account trash-bin size that overrides the calculated default."
msgstr ""
"For konti uden kvote beregnes papirkurvens standardgrænse i stedet ud fra "
"den ledige plads i filsystemet. En administrator kan tilsidesætte den "
"beregnede standard ved at sætte en størrelse for papirkurven for alle eller "
"for den enkelte konto."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:50
msgid ""
"Your administrator can also configure minimum and maximum trash-bin "
"retention periods, or disable automatic expiration. See the `Deleted Files "
"section of the Administrator Manual "
"<https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/configuration_files/trashbin_configuration.html>`_"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"Din administrator kan også sætte minimale og maksimale opbevaringsperioder "
"for papirkurven eller slå automatisk udløb fra. Se `afsnittet om slettede "
"filer i dokumentationen til administration "
"<https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/configuration_files/trashbin_configuration.html>`_"
" for at få flere oplysninger."
